{"id":"poltora","lemma":"полтора","pos":"num","rank":1937,"glosses":["one and a half (1½), sesqui-"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я ждал полтора часа.","en":"I waited an hour and a half.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wait for","l":"ждать"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"час"}]},{"text":"Полтора часа — это 90 минут.","en":"An hour and a half is ninety minutes.","words":[null,{"g":"hour","l":"час"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Том умер полтора года назад.","en":"Tom died a year and a half ago.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"},{"g":"back"}]},{"text":"Ехать полтора часа на работу — тягомотина.","en":"Driving for one and a half hours to get to work is a bear.","words":[{"g":"to go"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"час"},{"g":"on / at"},null,null]},{"text":"Я прождал полтора часа.","en":"I've been waiting for an hour and a half.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"hour","l":"час"}]}]}